# Draft DRAFT-symfpu-20190517-traits-backend: exercise a trait-based numeric library through a real backend
id: DRAFT-symfpu-20190517-traits-backend
trigger_tool: Conan test_package / C++ compiler
phase: testing
error_signature: no upstream build or test target|test_package.*only includes.*template headers
severity: 1
category: conan, testing, cxx, header-only
match_keywords: SymFPU, traits, concrete backend, template instantiation, bit-vector, test_package
title: Header-only trait algorithms need a concrete backend consumer test
root_cause: SymFPU core algorithms are class/function templates parameterized by a traits type. The pinned 2019-05-17 source archive contains the generic core and utility headers but no concrete baseTypes backend, build system, or test suite; including headers alone does not instantiate or execute the floating-point algorithms.
affected_scope: C++ template libraries whose algorithms depend on a user-supplied numeric or bit-vector backend, especially header-only SMT or symbolic arithmetic libraries.
verification_cmd: conan create archives/s/symfpu/0.0-git20190517.8fbe139 -pr:h ohos-aarch64 -pr:b ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: instantiate-template-api-with-test-only-backend
rec_description: Compile a test-only concrete backend alongside the consumer, link the package's public headers through CMakeDeps, and call the actual generic unpack, arithmetic, and pack APIs with known bit patterns. Keep the backend out of the published package.
rec_command: conan create archives/s/symfpu/0.0-git20190517.8fbe139 -pr:h ohos-aarch64 -pr:b ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: The test_package uses the official simpleExecutable traits backend as test support and directly instantiates the 2019 core's unpack, add, multiply, and pack templates; it checks IEEE-754 encodings for round-trip, 1.0+2.0, and 2.0*3.0. The backend is not installed into the package.
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: header include-only smoke test|claim upstream tests passed when the source archive has no tests
forbid_1_reason: A translation unit that only includes headers does not instantiate the trait-dependent arithmetic, and no upstream test count can be inferred from a missing suite.
forbid_1_consequence: Package validation can falsely pass without checking the backend contract or can report fabricated upstream coverage.
